    "identifier": "konjiki-steel-release-steel-spear",
    "description": "<p>You conjure a massive spear made of steel before sending it flying towards a target within range, make a ranged ninjutsu (or taijutsu) attack, dealing your [Weapon Damage] + 5d8.</p>\n<p>If you score a critical hit with this attack, the spear splinters and explodes, tripling the damage dice, instead of doubling them.</p>\n<p>Alomancy Infusion. If you have the Steel Reinforcement or Super Sharp Alomancy Technique; you can spend up to 2 ingots as part of this jutsu’s casting to gain a +1 bonus to this attacks critical threat range for each ingot spent.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the damage by 1d8.</p>",
